1
00:00:09,541 --> 00:00:14,222
When everything’s on fire, I don’t blame the sky.

2
00:00:15,642 --> 00:00:19,282
I look inside, where the answers hide.

3
00:00:19,302 --> 00:00:22,943
The world is loud -

4
00:00:24,403 --> 00:00:29,264
I stay quiet.

5
00:00:29,304 --> 00:00:31,324
TV keeps yelling: “Someone’s to blame”,

6
00:00:31,744 --> 00:00:33,684
But on my chart I see spring in the flame.

7
00:00:33,704 --> 00:00:36,204
Yeah, inflation’s a wave - I ride, not complain,

8
00:00:36,504 --> 00:00:38,545
Life ain’t a crisis, it’s an update in the game.

9
00:00:38,845 --> 00:00:41,065
World’s tearing seams, still glowing screens,

10
00:00:41,285 --> 00:00:43,505
They invest in fear, I invest in schemes.

11
00:00:43,745 --> 00:00:45,766
Rates won’t save you, speeches won’t too,

12
00:00:46,326 --> 00:00:48,126
If you don’t build a Fed inside of you.

13
00:00:48,186 --> 00:00:52,566
Let the prices rise - I lift my soul,

14
00:00:53,566 --> 00:00:56,507
Every pullback makes me whole.

15
00:00:56,527 --> 00:01:02,027
The world legalizes pain - I legalize light,

16
00:01:02,968 --> 00:01:06,288
I don’t run from storms, I greet the night.

17
00:01:07,768 --> 00:01:10,148
They say: “It’s a crisis, save who you can”,

18
00:01:10,509 --> 00:01:12,509
I see a script, not the end of man.

19
00:01:12,549 --> 00:01:14,869
Every storm is a system reset,

20
00:01:15,109 --> 00:01:17,269
Inflation? Fine. I handle that bet.

21
00:01:17,669 --> 00:01:19,890
Blaming the system kills the now,

22
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:22,270
I’m in the flow, my mind’s the cloud.

23
00:01:22,570 --> 00:01:24,650
Every percent like a heartbeat sign,

24
00:01:24,930 --> 00:01:26,971
Money shows up when you’re aligned.

25
00:01:26,991 --> 00:01:30,991
Let the prices rise - I lift my soul,

26
00:01:32,371 --> 00:01:35,292
Every pullback makes me bold.

27
00:01:35,812 --> 00:01:40,672
The world legalizes pain - I legalize light,

28
00:01:40,712 --> 00:01:45,033
I don’t run from storms, I greet the night.

29
00:01:46,573 --> 00:01:48,813
They hike the rates - I hike my dream,

30
00:01:49,033 --> 00:01:51,173
They count the dollars, I count the beam.

31
00:01:51,533 --> 00:01:53,634
Smoke and mirrors, market charade,

32
00:01:53,714 --> 00:01:56,374
But inside myself I anchored my trade.

33
00:01:56,474 --> 00:01:58,394
Let it get costly - I’m not broke,

34
00:01:58,734 --> 00:02:00,795
My wealth is family, blood and hope.

35
00:02:01,175 --> 00:02:03,355
When everything falls, I stand aligned,

36
00:02:03,375 --> 00:02:05,775
‘Cause my real market’s the state of mind.

37
00:02:05,795 --> 00:02:09,616
Let the charts keep shifting - I keep my core,

38
00:02:11,356 --> 00:02:14,456
Every crisis opens a door.

39
00:02:15,516 --> 00:02:19,317
When the system overheats and panics loud,

40
00:02:20,757 --> 00:02:24,417
I stay cool - truth is my crowd.

41
00:02:25,278 --> 00:02:26,498
I don’t hunt the guilty,

42
00:02:26,758 --> 00:02:28,898
I hunt the meaning.

43
00:02:30,738 --> 00:02:32,778
Inflation is temporary.

44
00:02:32,818 --> 00:02:35,139
Faith is compounding.

